<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-28T00:08:55.860Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 00:08:55 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security officials met in Jammu to review anti-infiltration measures while Manipur security forces buried seven Kuki civilians killed by militants after two months and relocated the BSF Raising Day parade to Delhi over security concerns. China and India held fresh border talks as both sides increased military readiness before winter. A bear attack injured five people in Udhampur and a leopard injured a seven-year-old boy in Kupwara shortly after a fatal attack in the same district. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3376066/china-and-india-hold-fresh-border-talks-both-boost-military-readiness-winter&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Excelsior&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxPRW0wdW54V1NhVTMxWU1zM1pGWFFhN1M3RWJORWdxNE9OaTBfODJ2QXhqSm9GdnVhZFFFZFVHZTl0SlJmQkM1M3J1dGo1bDJ4QndMVlJJTXBBTDB0TmhJd1F1OXJmNFhyZ0xyeVd5S3JOaklwRG9xbFNxS0dSVWNpc1UzbjNETXo2WURyV2t0UmxfX05JQlVScF9XVm15OU5sWTRTR2FsLXlxNGdoOVY5YmQzRlhUalFaUnVGZnJB?oc=5&quot;&gt;thekashmirimages.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNdTRXNTlYWEVUQ1AtNlBWbVM4YTlGUkZucndsUFpCQXRHeXB3MzVTeGZ1Q2RjcEpGYWZXcUJvcW5hVllhVnhBMGNSMFZPa0ZCSDJROFgxeGtjTjlINlhCMklFSUloSG5tTjN2WVBicHh5LU5EdEVxUjB6SkNJSE50d24xQXduLUtZXy1FMUU3NDZYcEpWUlZicmN3TUY1NWpNblZ4emdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rising Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNbl9sOUV3RUdhaXpRSEQ0Xzdjc2NVemZWRGFYangwYUtxZnE5YzRsZWpDMF9kZi1CSVE3Qm5Kbi1KVVc2Vm91NDJoTkJGbmZG